  {
   "v": "ilona",
   "t": "Не надо туда смотреть.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Don't look over there.' The negative expression tells someone not to look in that direction.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "ilona",
   "t": "Смотри на меня и улыбайся.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Look at me and smile.' The command form directs him to face her with a warm expression.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "ilona",
   "t": "Не пей, делай вид.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Don't drink, just pretend.' The command instructs him to only simulate drinking wine.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "ilona",
   "t": "Скажи мне какое-нибудь слово.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Say some word to me.' The indefinite pronoun asks for any random word to simulate dialogue.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Блинчики?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
